# Logo

The quotation mark is violet `#5B49C7`. The CashNarra name stays ink `#29263D`. Do not paint the name violet, and do not paint the mark ink, on a light surface.

- Light screens use `public/brand/cashnarra-logo.svg`: introduction, sign-in, privacy, and the app header.
- Dark surfaces use `public/brand/cashnarra-lockup-reversed.svg` (white). Do not put the ink name on a dark background.
- An icon with no name uses `public/brand/cashnarra-symbol.svg`.
- Do not switch those screens to `cashnarra-lockup-violet.svg` or `cashnarra-lockup.svg`.
- Do not redraw the mark as rectangles or squares. Keep the speech-mark path.

```tsx
// Light header
<img src="/brand/cashnarra-logo.svg" alt="CashNarra" />

// Dark header
<img src="/brand/cashnarra-lockup-reversed.svg" alt="CashNarra" />
```
